  "description": "Joo Yeomin, a diligent college student burdened by an unjust debt, struggles to make ends meet through multiple odd jobs while evading persistent loan sharks. His wary nature around strangers is understandable, especially when he keeps encountering one in particular! Enter Yeon Tae-seo, the privileged chaebol heir. To Tae-seo, Yeomin appears at the most inconvenient times, sparking suspicions of paparazzi. Determined to put Yeomin in his place, Tae-seo initiates a high-stakes game of cat and mouse. But what happens when both players risk getting caught in their own trap? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
